        "how_to_tell_apart": "Polyarteritis nodosa inflames medium arteries, spares the lungs and glomeruli and is ANCA-negative; microscopic polyangiitis inflames small vessels, causes glomerulonephritis and lung hemorrhage and is usually MPO-ANCA positive."
      }
    ],
